  "saturationIntro": "Each marker is tested with PhyKIT (Philippe et al. 2011): IQ-TREE infers the tree of the gene, then, for the 1st, 2nd and 3rd codon positions (and 1st+2nd, all sites), PhyKIT regresses the uncorrected p-distance of every pair of taxa on their distance in the tree. A value near 1 means no saturation; the closer to 0, the more the observed differences hide repeated substitutions.",
